<title>POLAND: CELULOZA APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>CELULOZA APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997	1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.34 vs   6.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.19 vs  13.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.24 vs  10.56</p>
<p> Sales		   59.51 vs  55.65</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997	1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.84 vs  32.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	18.77 vs  65.31</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.67 vs  60.42</p>
<p> Sales		  220.26 vs 243.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paper maker is Zaklady Celulozy</p>
<p>i Papieru w Swieciu Celuloza SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
